# "{2}, {T}: Choose one that hasn't been chosen" (CR 700.2). Bot1 casts Three Bowls of Porridge on turn 1 with Mox Pearl and Mox Jet. Bot2 casts Grizzly Bears and Llanowar Elves
# on turn 2. Turn 3: the first mode deals 2 damage to the Bears, which dies. Turn 5: that mode is refused now, the second mode taps the Elves. Turn 7: both are refused and the
# third mode sacrifices the Bowls and gains 3 life (23). A chosen mode stays chosen for the object; the Bowls is gone afterwards.

